  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project helps to improve the general well-being, health, and living situations of slum dwellers by tackling four specific challenges that are common in Kathmandu&apos;s slum areas. It deals with health inequalities, reduces poverty, boosts access to clean water, and fosters cooperative relationships for sustainable development in Kathmandu&apos;s slum areas, while addressing problems of Health Disparities, reducing high incidence of dengue and increase access to essential health sevices on dengue.</narrative>
  </description>
